      "role": "assistant",
      "schema_version": "conversational_runtime_operation_marathon_1_v1",
      "text": "I understand. I will treat this as ordinary conversation unless you make it a goal, correction, or authority-changing request.",
      "turn_id": "conversation-turn-a3bc7eb6aa1c4b96"
    },
    {
      "created_at": "2026-07-27T17:24:41+00:00",
      "intent_type": "ordinary_conversation",
      "objective_id": "conversational-objective-1892984d921a665c",
      "role": "user",
      "schema_version": "conversational_runtime_operation_marathon_1_v1",
      "text": "What is angular momentum? Do not use my reference correction unless it actually matters.",
      "turn_id": "conversation-turn-ee8ab0d0d42d36dd"
    },
    {
      "created_at": "2026-07-27T17:24:41+00:00",
      "intent_type": "ordinary_response",
      "objective_id": "conversational-objective-1892984d921a665c",
      "role": "assistant",
      "schema_version": "conversational_runtime_operation_marathon_1_v1",
      "text": "Angular momentum is the rotational counterpart of linear momentum. It depends on how much mass is rotating, how far it is from the axis, and how fast it is rotating.",
      "turn_id": "conversation-turn-89f78bf2daa1e617"
    },
    {
      "created_at": "2026-07-27T17:24:43+00:00",
      "intent_type": "ordinary_conversation",
      "objective_id": "conversational-objective-1892984d921a665c",
      "role": "user",
      "schema_version": "conversational_runtime_operation_marathon_1_v1",
      "text": "What is Euclidean geometry?",
      "turn_id": "conversation-turn-7dc92d216f659045"
    },
    {
      "created_at": "2026-07-27T17:24:43+00:00",
      "intent_type": "ordinary_response",
      "objective_id": "conversational-objective-1892984d921a665c",
      "role": "assistant",
      "schema_version": "conversational_runtime_operation_marathon_1_v1",
      "text": "Euclidean geometry is the geometry of flat space: points, lines, angles, triangles, circles, and shapes measured with Euclid's familiar rules.",
      "turn_id": "conversation-turn-67bf0729f04ad219"
    },
    {
      "created_at": "2026-07-27T17:24:44+00:00",
      "intent_type": "direct_correction",
      "objective_id": "conversational-objective-1892984d921a665c",
      "role": "user",
      "schema_version": "conversational_runtime_operation_marathon_1_v1",
